{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21992","headline":"续古诗十首 八 · 白居易","name":"续古诗十首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心亦无所迫，身亦无所拘。\n何爲肠中气，郁郁不得舒。\n不舒良有以，同心久离居。\n五年不见面，三年不得书。\n念此令人老，抱膝坐长吁。\n岂无盈尊酒，非君谁与娱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}